S[andra Antonovic], the company's[ Chief] Operating[ Officer] (COO), says that, "it is a safer method than the traditional rope basket, because it protects the passengers in the event of a lateral or vertical impact, fall or heavy landing. Furthermore, the[ buoy]ancy panels enable the device to float and self-align."
