=== Text #1 ===
> [Wednesday], December[ 19], 2018 — Anaheim, California, December 20, 2018 – Premium German interface[ manufacturer] RME is pulling out all the stops at this year’s NAMM Show, hosting appearances at its booth 14702 every hour by a range of top audio professionals and[ musicians] who are shaping the future of their respective disciplines. Appearances will include film[ composer Adam Barber],[ Andy] Grammer[�]�s FOH team, metal[ guitarist Michael] Batio, legendary soul artist Ellis Hall,[ Icelandic drum]ming sensation Gulli[ Bri]em,[ Brazilian guitarist] Lari[ Basil]io and legendary[ bass]ist Chuck Rainey with[ veteran drummer John] Martinez.
